# .gitignore — Harbor .NET project

## .NET artifacts
bin/
obj/
artifacts/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.user
*.suo
*.cache
*.log
*.tlog

## Visual Studio / Rider / VSCode
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.userprefs
*.swp
*~
*_wpftmp.csproj
*_wpftmp.*

## Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
# The compiled gate binary IS committed: a gate has to run where there is
# no SDK and no build of Harbor, and the binary is what runs there. The
# ignore rule above is for build output.
!tools/bin/
!tools/bin/harbor-gates-linux-x64
!tools/bin/harbor-gates-linux-arm64
!tools/bin/SHA256SUMS
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

## NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/[Pp]ackages/*
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json

## Test results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
TestResults/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage/
coverage*.xml
coverage*.json
*.trx
*.scratom

## AOT / publish artifacts
publish/
native/
*.so
*.dylib
*.a

## OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

